{"server":"cn","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_01_beg","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_01","title":"6:44P.M.","storyCode":"CB-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e5192d8682e5b345247bde5fcc99b967c3a0526bd9df214f5dffa2ee595f39ec","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorway"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:44 P.M.    天气/晴\n龙门绕城公路，车内"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爷，您睡着了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，抱歉......我们到哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就快到约定的碰头地点了，请打起精神来，少爷。企鹅物流的诸位已经在等着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您看上去很疲惫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"请原谅我多嘴，但老爷这次的决定实在是有些仓促，如果少爷有什么难处，请务必开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......父亲，一定有他自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，只要能在企鹅物流有所作为，父亲身边的那些人，说不定就不会再阻拦我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爷是家族有史以来最年轻的信使，您的工作能力无可挑剔，这就足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧，但是，那些大人们未必会这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"看看窗外，现在龙门大半的民营信使业务已经落到了父亲的手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"企鹅物流，他们是最后的，也是最独立的，奇怪传闻最多的公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然父亲和大帝先生的关系好像很好，可我们必须了解他们，至少我得这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才会担心少爷，企鹅物流太过于特殊了，我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用总摆出这么一副表情。我可以自己处理好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"您也是，少爷。多像同龄人一样笑一笑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚是安魂夜，您本可以和朋友们一起去街上逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是在嘲笑我没朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"岂敢，岂敢，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，少爷，您的盾还在手边吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"我们被盯上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"发现目标，准备好了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，引爆组的导火索似乎有点短......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那不是问题，动手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——爆炸！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爷，抓稳了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"发现目标，还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把他带走，动作快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（居然炸毁了公路.....？到底，是谁......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（该死，视野......看不清......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"目击者很多，但没有看见其他目标人员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，烟雾里还有其他人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有幸存者？那就一起——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂？喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么简单就被干掉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，我可不喜欢这么老套的电影戏码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"企鹅物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哟，看来你很清楚嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不过在我看来，在边郊公路中央设置路障再埋下炸弹，这手法也是相当复古哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爆破只是个人爱好，环顾一下你的周围，事情没这么简单。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，那个蠢货竟然用了这么多源石炸药，如果让鼠王知道了，我们吃不了兜着走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"发现企鹅物流的信使，是能天使。她把爆破组的人都给......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我不瞎，没所谓。那只叫德克萨斯的狼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没有看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。那就算了，包围他们，速战速决。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"果然还有埋伏，做得挺彻底嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你还能动吗？手脚都摇摇晃晃的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......勉强吧，你就是......能天使小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！你是叫，呃，什么来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"拜松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我们得先离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不要绷着一张脸，那位老管家平安无事哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且有把他送到路边，不过看他的样子其实不太需要帮忙......但是算啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"企鹅物流的能天使，还有这位小少爷，投降吧，跟我们走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不少生面孔呢，都是你在叙拉古的亲戚？有没有提醒他们在龙门抢生意的注意事项？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"这不关你事，这一次，我们会把你们彻底击溃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......在龙门呆了这么多年，你们抢地盘的方式倒是最简单粗暴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"看来叙拉古的黑手党也不是只有在酒吧挨揍的份嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊......你会后悔小看西西里人的，*龙门粗口*，动手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我这算勉强赶上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"时机完美，可颂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们好像不打算收手哎，接下来怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"老规矩，你开路，我殿后，完事儿奖金对半分~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就——不客气了啊啊啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那个怪力疯子直接撞开了一条路！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们先追，不要跟太紧，等首领的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把他们放跑了，废物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，绑票本来就不是我的长项。企鹅物流其他成员没有出现，部署完成之前，贸然进入龙门市区对我们不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"随便你找借口，有一辆车向你那儿去了。开着敞篷，可都是熟到发焦的老熟人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么快？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好，这是第几个死胡同了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"反正周围都是些几百年没人管的烂尾楼，不如直接在墙上开个洞呗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，两位！我们到底要去哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们在这儿！居然钻到死胡同里等死，包围他们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这不是无路可退了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"对了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么对策！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还没正式打过招呼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"把他们全部干掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是说这个的时候吧！这很重要吗！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这很重要，非常重要，相当重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们可是非常注重塑造企业文化的，而今天的文化关键词恰好是“仪式感”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然是刚刚决定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是大帝！快通知首领！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，后面还有一个！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"饵撒空了，能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古的家伙们也不全是傻瓜嘛，下次还有机会，别介意别介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"比起这个，给你们介绍一下，这位就是咱们企鹅物流的临时成员，拜松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙堵住了退路，只、只能动手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"都躺下，轮不到你们送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！不要慌，只要拖到首领的支援——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_2_off"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"拖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"开灯，啊哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_2_on"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_2_on"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_2_on"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_2_on"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好闪！哪儿来的聚光灯！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎来到企鹅物流，小猫小狗们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你们已经出现在我的视线之内，而我视线之内就是企鹅帝国的国土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，请问你们的过境签证有带在身上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们得准备好滚回娘家哭鼻子了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可颂"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
